<h1 style="font-size:20px;margin:0 0 16px;">TransTeira</h1>
<p>Hello,</p>
<p>An administrator account has been created for you on TransTeira.</p>
<p>User name: <strong>{{username}}</strong><br>Entities: <strong>{{tenant_names}}</strong></p>
<p>Open the link below to choose your password and set up two-factor authentication. This step is mandatory: have an authenticator app ready on your phone.</p>
<p><a href="{{activation_link}}" style="padding:12px 20px;background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;border-radius:4px;">Activate my account</a></p>
<p>If the button does not work, copy this address into your browser:<br><span style="word-break:break-all;">{{activation_link}}</span></p>
<p>The link can be used only once and is valid until {{expires_at}}.</p>
<p>The activation page is on <strong>{{admin_host}}</strong>. Check the address before you enter anything. TransTeira never asks for your password by e-mail.</p>
<p>If you did not expect this message, or if the link was already used, warn the administrator of the instance.</p>
<hr style="border:0;border-top:1px solid #767676;margin:24px 0 16px;">
<p style="font-size:14px;color:#4a4a4a;">This message was sent automatically by TransTeira. Please do not reply to it.</p>
